{"id":"u-6586a724-707e-408d-bf84-0d8023aec6f8","src":"community","title":"HB Strength + Hypertrophy","author":"Harry Byrne","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/IE5VVm-hb-strength-hypertrophy","desc":"Each session has a main compound lift to start. I would say it's the priority for each workout. Everything else whether machine or free weight work is accessory to the main lift. Rep ranges stay the same through weeks 1 to 4. Week 5, main compound rep ranges drop slightly with less accessory volume. Week 6 is general testing phase. Close to max effort. 1 rep in reserve/RPE 9.  Repeat program to increase 3-5 rep max over time and build some muscle in the process. Exercises are easily changeable but the main compounds are ones i've chose based on experience that reap the most reward. Do what you want with it to make it more enjoyable. Feedback is greatly appreciated. Thanks.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-05-02T21:54:27.048Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper session (Push focused)","Lower session (Push focused)","Upper session (Pull Focused)","Lower session (Pull focused)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Pull-Up","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Overhead Extension (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Box Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Zercher Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Hyperextension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hanging Knee Raise","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":1